IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. MULTIPLY-DEMO.
       AUTHOR. VALIDATION-PLATFORM.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-A              PIC 9(4) VALUE 10.
       01  WS-B              PIC 9(4) VALUE 5.
       01  WS-RESULT         PIC 9(8) VALUE 0.
       01  WS-TEMP           PIC 9(4) VALUE 3.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-LOGIC.
           DISPLAY "MULTIPLY DEMO STARTED".

           DISPLAY "WS-A=" WS-A.
           DISPLAY "WS-B=" WS-B.

           MULTIPLY WS-A BY WS-B GIVING WS-RESULT.
           DISPLAY "MULTIPLY A BY B GIVING RESULT=" WS-RESULT.

           MULTIPLY 4 BY WS-A.
           DISPLAY "MULTIPLY 4 BY A (in-place) A=" WS-A.

           MULTIPLY WS-B BY WS-TEMP GIVING WS-RESULT.
           DISPLAY "MULTIPLY B BY TEMP GIVING RESULT=" WS-RESULT.

           MULTIPLY WS-A BY WS-B GIVING WS-RESULT.
           DISPLAY "MULTIPLY A BY B GIVING RESULT=" WS-RESULT.

           STOP RUN.